		"description": {
			"value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] has these weaknesses:</p><p><strong>Forbiddance.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] can't enter a residence without an invitation from an occupant.</p><p><strong>Running Water.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] takes [[/damage 20 acid]] if it ends its turn in running water.</p><p><strong>Stake to the Heart.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] is destroyed if a weapon that deals &amp;reference[Piercing] damage is driven into the [[lookup @name lowercase]]'s heart while the [[lookup @name lowercase]] has the &amp;reference[Incapacitated] condition.</p><p><strong>Sunlight.</strong> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] takes [[/damage 20 radiant]] damage if it starts its turn in sunlight. While in sunlight, it has &amp;reference[Disadvantage] on &amp;reference[attackrolls]{attack rolls} and &amp;reference[abilitycheck]{ability checks}.</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
